---
import DefaultLayout from "../layouts/default.astro";
---

<DefaultLayout>
	<main>
		<h1>Downloads</h1>
		<h2>macOS (Apple Silicon)</h2>
		<p>
			<a href="https://github.com/ff6347/giclang/releases/tag/v0.9.0-beta.4">
				GiC v0.9.0-beta.4 for macOS — DMG
			</a>
		</p>
		<h2>Linux (64-bit Intel/AMD)</h2>
		<p>
			<a href="https://github.com/ff6347/giclang/releases/tag/v0.9.0-beta.4">
				GiC v0.9.0-beta.4 for Linux — AppImage and Debian package
			</a>
		</p>
		<h2>Windows (64-bit Intel/AMD)</h2>
		<p>
			No published Windows installer yet. An unsigned installer is planned for
			the next beta on
			<a href="https://github.com/ff6347/giclang/releases">GitHub Releases</a>.
		</p>
		<p>Published installers include SHA-256 checksum files.</p>
		<p>
			<strong>SmartScreen warning:</strong> The Windows installer is unsigned.
			Windows may show “Windows protected your PC” or identify the publisher as
			unknown. Only proceed if you downloaded it from this project's GitHub
			repository and trust the source. If available, choose “More info”, then
			“Run anyway”. Do not disable SmartScreen; if your school or computer
			policy blocks installation, ask the administrator.
		</p>
		<p>Intel Mac installers are not available yet.</p>
	</main>
</DefaultLayout>
